('caa00000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002', '00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001', 'ca000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001', 'ASSISTANT', 'Based on your current data, the following assets need attention:\n\n1. **Pump C** (Slurry Pump) - CRITICAL: Active seal leak, WO-2026-00005 in progress\n2. **HVAC Unit 2** - CRITICAL: Compressor failure, WO-2026-00009 assigned\n3. **Packaging Machine 2** - MEDIUM: Jam fault, WO-2026-00012 in progress\n4. **Conveyor C-13** - DEGRADED: Belt misalignment, WO-2026-00008 open\n\nWould you like me to provide more details on any of these work orders?'::text, true, 'METADATA_ONLY', '2026-04-28T10:00:05Z');
